{"title":"Human","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 1 Human that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-13.3px,-3.6px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/-1/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/3/0/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px\"><i style=\"left:19.9px;top:-4.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:33.0px;top:-58.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:18.6px;top:2.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:37.8px;top:2.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:-18.6px;top:-12.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:6.2px;top:14.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:29.6px;top:28.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:-15.8px;top:30.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:-11.7px;top:27.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:32.7px;top:21.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:-11.7px;top:16.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:2.1px;top:-10.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:-4.1px;top:1.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:-4.8px;top:8.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:-33.7px;top:-2.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:53.6px;top:15.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:11.0px;top:-25.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:-11.7px;top:55.0px\"></i></div><figcaption>Binxonia</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 16 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/p